00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:28.060
We'll find out Naismith, Player of the Year, Coach of the Year, DPOI on Wednesday.
我们将在周三揭晓奈史密斯年度最佳球员、年度最佳教练和最佳防守球员奖。

226
00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:35.640
And I want to talk feel-good stories, too, because I think so many players have great stories as well.
我也想谈谈那些温馨的故事，因为我觉得很多球员也有很棒的经历。

227
00:11:35.640 --> 00:11:38.720
